9️⃣ Perfect Interview Answer (GS Level)

If asked:

“How do you prevent an API Gateway from becoming a single point of failure?”

You can answer:

We deploy multiple gateway instances behind a load balancer so that traffic is distributed. Health checks remove failed instances automatically. In containerized environments we use Kubernetes for auto-scaling and self-healing. Additionally, we implement circuit breakers and monitoring to handle downstream failures and detect issues early.